OL,3,GNEWSAIreland's Junior Eurovision duo to
OL,4,Astep onto 'magical' stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey both feel comfortably at home in
OL,7,Fthe spotlight, but as they prepare for
OL,8,Fthe biggest show of their young lives,
OL,9,FIreland's junior Eurovision singers
OL,10,Fadmit some nerves are creeping in.
OL,12,FJunior Eurovision Song Contest 2026
OL,13,Fwill be held on Saturday in Malta.
OL,15,FIreland's representatives feature
OL,16,FNaomi, 13, from Mayobridge, County Down
OL,17,Fand 14-year-old Caleb from Dublin. They
OL,18,Fare the contest's only duo.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
