OL,3,GNEWSAIreland's Junior Eurovision duo to
OL,4,Astep onto 'magical' stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey are among 15 other nations that
OL,7,Fwill compete to win the contest, which
OL,8,Fwill be staged under the theme The
OL,9,FFesta, a vibrant celebration of Malta's
OL,10,Fvillage tradition.
